# IDE
.idea/

# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/

# BenchmarkDotNet
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# Timestamped local benchmark runs; named labels (validated/, release/) are committed receipts
benchmarks/*/results/20*

# Generated fixtures — regenerated by `dotnet run --project benchmarks/Generate -- .`
# (and GenerateHooks for ReceiverLink) when missing; index data stays tracked under Generate/Data
benchmarks/*/Generated/
benchmarks/Dispatch/ReceiverLink.g.cs

# Rider per-user settings
*.DotSettings.user
__pycache__/
!benchmarks/FusionHour/Generated/
